                           "TextFadeDuration": 10.5,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Objectives:\n• Recapture the three tribute wagons (Artifacts) and deliver them to the palace (foot of the Wonder) in Ctesiphon.\n• Destroy all Palmyran and Parthian Stables.",
                           "ImageRect": {
